title: "Agentic-SpliceAI"
abstract: >-
  An open-source framework for adaptive splice-site prediction and novel
  isoform discovery, combining foundation models, multimodal biological
  evidence, and agentic AI reasoning for context-aware discovery of
  disease-specific, variant-induced, and tissue-specific splice variants.
